## Context

Author request, 2026-10-29. Round 1 was `3dc7ef05` (2026-10-28): the shared
ethic and consultation moved to `references/doctor-practice.md`. Since then
the merge-path and review-trajectory probes landed. Measured on origin/main
683d6e77: `skills/harness-doctor/SKILL.md` 122 lines, references 246 lines
(authoring-skills 58, checklist 30, doctor-practice 64, evidence 10,
runtime-diagnostics 84). The probe table rows are the longest lines.

Ticket 1335 adds a docs visit to this skill; slimming first keeps that
addition from landing on a heavier body.

## Intent

Cut what a visit does not need resident: text restating another skill or
reference (point instead), rationale that belongs in `references/evidence.md`
or git history, probe rows whose cost and control fit in one line. Remove whole
passages before condensing (`skills/cut-prose/SKILL.md`). No behaviour change.

## Exit criteria

- [ ] SKILL.md and references measured before and after, line counts in the PR
- [ ] Every probe of the menu still runs as documented (its control fires)
- [ ] No new tests; existing harness-doctor tests pass
